⍝!DIGITS 10
⍝!WIDTH 79
)WSID GRAPHICS
PAIRS←12 2⍴1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 1 3 2 4 5 7 6 8 1 5 2 6 3 7 4 8
∇DESCRIBE
'GRAPHICS -- PICTURES ON THE COLOR DISPLAY, THROUGH AP205.'
''
'   SHOW       THE CUBE, TURNED: A WIREFRAME IN CYAN, RED AND WHITE.'
'   TURN N     TURN THE CUBE THROUGH N STEPS, DRAWING EACH,'
'              A TENTH OF A SECOND APART.'
'   CUBE A     THE CUBE TURNED BY A RADIANS.'
'   WAVE       A SINE WAVE AND ITS AXES.'
'   SIERPINSKI PASCAL''S TRIANGLE, MOD 2.'
'   CARPET     SIERPINSKI''S CARPET, FROM THE DIGITS IN BASE 3.'
'   MANDELBROT THE MANDELBROT SET, ON A GRID OF 160 BY 100.'
'   LISSAJOUS  SINES OF 3T AND 2T, ONE AGAINST THE OTHER.'
'   DEMO N     N ROUNDS OF THEM ALL: THE CUBE TURNING, THEN EACH PICTURE,'
'              EACH HELD 2 SECONDS BY ⎕DL.'
'   MONO       BACK TO THE MONOCHROME DISPLAY.'
''
'SHARE OFFERS CTL AND DAT TO AP205; COLORS MAKES FOUR FIELDS, EACH'
'THE WHOLE SCREEN: CYAN, RED AND WHITE PIXELS, AND A TITLE LINE.'
'F PLOT P LIGHTS THE POINTS P IN FIELD F; DRAW F SENDS THE 64000'
'PIXELS IN DAT TO FIELD F. A PICTURE OF ONES AND ZEROS IS HELD A'
'BIT A PIXEL: 8000 BYTES.'
∇
∇SHARE;Z
⍝ OFFER THE CONTROL AND DATA VARIABLES TO AP205.
Z←205 ⎕SVO 2 3⍴'CTLDAT'
→(∧/2=⎕SVO 2 3⍴'CTLDAT')/0
'AP205 DID NOT ACCEPT CTL AND DAT.'
∇
∇COLORS
⍝ COLOR, 40 A LINE: THREE FIELDS OF PIXELS, CYAN, RED AND WHITE,
⍝ EACH THE WHOLE SCREEN, AND A WHITE TITLE ON THE TOP LINE.
SHARE
CTL←0 4
DAT←4 6⍴1 1 25 40 2 1 1 1 25 40 2 2 1 1 25 40 2 3 1 1 1 40 2 3
CTL←1
∇
∇DRAW F
⍝ SEND THE PICTURE IN DAT, 200 ROWS OF 320, TO FIELD F: FIELD 1
⍝ REPLACES WHAT IS THERE, THE OTHERS ARE OR'ED WITH IT AND KEEP ITS
⍝ COLORS. DAT IS EMPTIED AFTER, TO MAKE ROOM FOR THE NEXT.
CTL←2,F,1+2×F>1
DAT←0
∇
∇TITLE T
DAT←T
CTL←2 4
∇
∇F PLOT P;K
⍝ P: A ROW OF X (0 TO 319) AND A ROW OF Y (0 TO 199). LIGHT THEM IN
⍝ FIELD F.
K←(P[1;]≥0)∧(P[1;]<320)∧(P[2;]≥0)∧P[2;]<200
DAT←64000⍴0
DAT[1+(K/P[1;])+320×K/P[2;]]←1
DRAW F
∇
∇P←A LINE B;N;T
⍝ THE POINTS FROM A TO B, EACH X AND Y: A COLUMN A POINT.
N←1⌈⌈/|B-A
T←(0,⍳N)÷N
P←⌊0.5+(A∘.+T×0)+(B-A)∘.×T
∇
∇P←EDGES M;I
⍝ M: AN EDGE A ROW, X0 Y0 X1 Y1. P: THE POINTS OF THEM ALL.
P←2 0⍴0
I←0
L:→(I≥1↑⍴M)/0
I←I+1
P←P,M[I;1 2] LINE M[I;3 4]
→L
∇
∇R←ROT A;B
⍝ TURN BY A ABOUT THE UPRIGHT AXIS, THEN BY A÷2 ABOUT THE ACROSS ONE.
R←3 3⍴(2○A),0,(1○A),0 1 0,(-1○A),0,2○A
B←A÷2
R←(3 3⍴1 0 0 0,(2○B),(-1○B),0,(1○B),2○B)+.×R
∇
∇CUBE A;V;W;F;X;Y;M;K
⍝ THE EIGHT CORNERS, TURNED, SEEN IN PERSPECTIVE; THE EDGES ALONG
⍝ EACH AXIS IN A COLOR OF THEIR OWN.
V←¯1+2×(3⍴2)⊤¯1+⍳8
W←(ROT A)+.×V
F←180÷5+W[3;]
X←⌊0.5+160+1.2×F×W[1;]
Y←⌊0.5+100-F×W[2;]
M←⍉4 12⍴X[PAIRS[;1]],Y[PAIRS[;1]],X[PAIRS[;2]],Y[PAIRS[;2]]
K←0
L:K←K+1
K PLOT EDGES M[(4×K-1)+⍳4;]
→(K<3)/L
∇
∇SHOW
COLORS
TITLE 'A WIREFRAME CUBE, IN COLOR'
CUBE 0.6
∇
∇TURN N;I;Z
COLORS
TITLE 'TURNING'
I←0
L:CUBE I×○2÷N
Z←⎕DL 0.1
I←I+1
→(I<N)/L
∇
∇WAVE;X;Y
COLORS
TITLE 'SINE, ONE PERIOD'
X←¯1+⍳320
Y←⌊0.5+100-80×1○X×○2÷320
1 PLOT 2 320⍴X,320⍴100
2 PLOT 2 200⍴(200⍴160),¯1+⍳200
3 PLOT 2 320⍴X,Y
∇
∇SIERPINSKI;R;I
⍝ EACH ROW THE ONE ABOVE, EXCLUSIVE-OR'ED WITH ITSELF MOVED ONE ON.
COLORS
TITLE 'PASCAL''S TRIANGLE, MOD 2'
DAT←200 320⍴0
R←320↑1
I←8
L:DAT[I;]←R
R←R≠0,¯1↓R
I←I+1
→(I≤199)/L
DAT←,DAT
DRAW 2
∇
∇LISSAJOUS;T
COLORS
TITLE 'LISSAJOUS, 3 AGAINST 2'
T←○(¯1+⍳2000)÷1000
3 PLOT ⌊0.5+2 2000⍴(160+120×1○3×T),100-85×1○2×T
∇
∇CARPET;A
⍝ A POINT IS DARK WHERE ITS ROW AND COLUMN HAVE A 1 IN THE SAME PLACE
⍝ IN BASE 3. 81 BY 81, EACH POINT 2 BY 2.
COLORS
TITLE 'SIERPINSKI''S CARPET'
A←1=(4⍴3)⊤¯1+⍳81
A←~(⍉A)∨.∧A
DAT←200 320⍴0
DAT[19+⍳162;79+⍳162]←A[⌈0.5×⍳162;⌈0.5×⍳162]
DAT←,DAT
DRAW 1
∇
∇MANDELBROT;CR;CI;ZR;ZI;T;I
⍝ Z←C+Z×Z, TWENTY TIMES, FROM 0; THE POINTS THAT STAY NEAR ARE LIT.
⍝ THE COMPLEX NUMBERS ARE CARRIED AS TWO REAL MATRICES, 100 BY 160,
⍝ EACH POINT 2 BY 2 ON THE SCREEN.
COLORS
TITLE 'THE MANDELBROT SET'
CR←100 160⍴¯2.2+3×(¯1+⍳160)÷160
CI←⍉160 100⍴¯1.2+2.4×(¯1+⍳100)÷100
ZR←CR×0
ZI←ZR
I←0
L:T←CR+(ZR×ZR)-ZI×ZI
ZI←¯4⌈4⌊CI+2×ZR×ZI
ZR←¯4⌈4⌊T
I←I+1
→(I<20)/L
T←4≥(ZR×ZR)+ZI×ZI
CR←CI←ZR←ZI←0
DAT←,T[⌈0.5×⍳200;⌈0.5×⍳320]
DRAW 3
∇
∇DEMO N;K;Z
⍝ N ROUNDS: THE CUBE TURNING, THEN EACH PICTURE, HELD 2 SECONDS
⍝ BY ⎕DL. ATTN STOPS IT.
K←0
L:→(K≥N)/0
K←K+1
TURN 24
SIERPINSKI
Z←⎕DL 2
CARPET
Z←⎕DL 2
MANDELBROT
Z←⎕DL 2
LISSAJOUS
Z←⎕DL 2
WAVE
Z←⎕DL 2
→L
∇
∇MONO
CTL←0 1
∇
